EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

Your Financial Aid Notification is now posted on My ASU under your Finances tab at https://my.asu.edu. Your next step is to act on your awards.

I encourage you to take advantage of our Student Budget Worksheet (https://students.asu.edu/financialaid/budget) to determine if you want to accept modify or decline any part of your financial aid package. Creating an annual budget helps you understand your total costs, how your financial aid awards help cover those costs and any remaining balance due to ASU after your aid is applied. When using this budget worksheet, refer to your FAN for a list of your offered awards.

If you have any questions regarding your FAN, please feel free to contact me or Financial Aid and Scholarship Services at https://students.asu.edu/contact/financialaid. I am happy to discuss the costs and how to pay for ASU and look forward to the opportunity to speak with you.

Sincerely,

{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}
Admission Services
{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}

If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.

{!Case.Thread_Id}
